msgstr "Tickets & Passes for WooCommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
#: tickets-passes-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "Sell tickets, timeslot bookings and passes with WooCommerce, and check visitors in at the door with a built-in QR scanner."
msgstr "Sälj biljetter, tidbokningar och pass med WooCommerce, och checka in besökare vid dörren med en inbyggd QR-scanner."

